+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
; Setup Transfers                                                   ;
+------------+----------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
; From Clock ; To Clock ; RR Paths ; FR Paths ; RF Paths ; FF Paths ;
+------------+----------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
; clk        ; clk      ; 256      ; 0        ; 0        ; 0        ;
+------------+----------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
